  "title": "31 January 1967: Filming: Strawberry Fields Forever",
  "date": "1967-01-31",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The second day of filming for the <a href=\"/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/\">‘Strawberry Fields Forever’</a> promotional clip took place on this day at Knole Park in Sevenoaks, Kent. <span id=\"more-6146\"></span></p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_37241\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"326\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HtUH9z_Oey8?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>On <a href=\"/1967/01/30/filming-strawberry-fields-forever/\">the previous day</a> The Beatles had intended to film a sequence in which <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> dropped down from a dead oak tree, but poor light meant it was not possible. That sequence, and several others, was filmed on this day.</p><p>In the final edit, the sequence was reversed so it looked as though McCartney leaped into the tree. The planned sequence involved him jumping from the tree and running backwards towards a piano.</p><p>The director of both the Strawberry Fields Forever and the <a href=\"/songs/penny-lane/\">‘Penny Lane’</a> clips was Peter Goldmann. The latter promo was filmed from <a href=\"/1967/02/05/filming-penny-lane/\">5 February 1967</a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/01/31/filming-strawberry-fields-forever-2/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-6146 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM0IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"134\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-200x134.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-200x134.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-580x389.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-960x643.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-768x515.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27124\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,670\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-960x643.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-200x133.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo Starr, Paul McCartney and John Lennon filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-580x385.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-960x636.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-768x509.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27125\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,663\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ringo Starr, Paul McCartney and John Lennon filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-960x636.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTMzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"133\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-133x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"George Harrison filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-133x200.jpg 133w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-386x580.jpg 386w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-638x960.jpg 638w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-768x1155.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 133px) 100vw, 133px\" data-attachment-id=\"27126\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1504\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-638x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"132\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-200x132.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-200x132.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-580x384.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-960x636.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-768x508.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27123\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,662\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-960x636.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>During a break in the filming <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> bought a circus poster dating from 1843 in an antique shop. The poster, which advertised a circus in Rochdale, subsequently provided the inspiration for <a href=\"/songs/being-for-the-benefit-of-mr-kite/\">‘Being For The Benefit Of Mr Kite!’</a> on the <a href=\"/albums/sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band/\">Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band</a> album.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1967-photos/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-27130\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1ODAiIGhlaWdodD0iNDcxIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTgwIDQ3MSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"27130\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"886,720\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon with the Mr Kite poster, 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-580x471.jpg\" alt=\"John Lennon with the Mr Kite poster, 1967\" width=\"580\" height=\"471\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-27130\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-580x471.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-200x163.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-768x624.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01.jpg 886w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 580px) 100vw, 580px\"></a></p><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 14 November 2022</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2013: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2013/01/31/stella-mccartney-creates-beatles-t-shirts-for-red-nose-day-2013/\">Stella McCartney creates Beatles t-shirts for Red Nose Day 2013</a></li><li>2010: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2010/01/31/the-beatles-win-grammy-award-for-all-together-now/\">The Beatles win Grammy Award for All Together Now</a></li><li>1980: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1980/01/31/john-lennon-yoko-ono-purchase-palm-beach-property/\">John Lennon and Yoko Ono purchase Palm Beach property</a></li><li>1977: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1977/01/31/recording-out-on-the-streets-can-she-do-it-like-she-dances-ringo-starr/\">Recording: Out On The Streets, Can She Do It Like She Dances? by Ringo Starr</a></li><li>1976: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1976/01/31/recording-shes-my-baby-the-note-you-never-wrote-time-to-hide-wings/\">Recording: She’s My Baby, The Note You Never Wrote, Time To Hide by Wings</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/01/31/recording-listen-to-what-the-man-said-my-carnival-crossroads-wings/\">Recording: Listen To What The Man Said, My Carnival, Crossroads by Wings</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/01/31/uk-single-release-9-dream-john-lennon/\">UK single release: #9 Dream by John Lennon</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/01/31/paul-mccartney-writes-give-ireland-back-to-the-irish/\">Paul McCartney writes Give Ireland Back To The Irish</a></li><li>1970: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1970/01/31/ringo-starr-maureen-fly-las-vegas-los-angeles/\">Ringo and Maureen fly from Las Vegas to Los Angeles</a></li><li>1969: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/01/31/get-back-let-it-be-sessions-day-22/\">Get Back/Let It Be sessions: day 22</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/01/31/live-olympia-theatre-paris-14/\">The Beatles live: Olympia Theatre, Paris</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/01/31/live-majestic-ballroom-birkenhead-15/\">The Beatles live: Majestic Ballroom, Birkenhead</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/01/31/live-cavern-club-liverpool-275/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/01/31/live-cavern-club-liverpool-126/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=82fc7d4208d78a2ac8a006b1274cc18e&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=6146&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "The second day of filming for the ‘Strawberry Fields Forever’ promotional clip took place on this day at Knole Park in Sevenoaks, Kent. On the previous day The Beatles had intended to film a sequence in which Paul McCartney dropped down from a dead oak tree, but poor light meant it was not possible. That sequence, and several others, was filmed on this day.In the final edit, the sequence was reversed so it looked as though McCartney leaped into the tree. The planned sequence involved him jumping from the tree and running backwards towards a piano.The director of both the Strawberry Fields Forever and the ‘Penny Lane’ clips was Peter Goldmann. The latter promo was filmed from 5 February 1967.\n\n\n\nDuring a break in the filming John Lennon bought a circus poster dating from 1843 in an antique shop. The poster, which advertised a circus in Rochdale, subsequently provided the inspiration for ‘Being For The Benefit Of Mr Kite!’ on the Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band album.Page last updated: 14 November 2022Also on this day...2013: Stella McCartney creates Beatles t-shirts for Red Nose Day 20132010: The Beatles win Grammy Award for All Together Now1980: John Lennon and Yoko Ono purchase Palm Beach property1977: Recording: Out On The Streets, Can She Do It Like She Dances? by Ringo Starr1976: Recording: She’s My Baby, The Note You Never Wrote, Time To Hide by Wings1975: Recording: Listen To What The Man Said, My Carnival, Crossroads by Wings1975: UK single release: #9 Dream by John Lennon1972: Paul McCartney writes Give Ireland Back To The Irish1970: Ringo and Maureen fly from Las Vegas to Los Angeles1969: Get Back/Let It Be sessions: day 221964: The Beatles live: Olympia Theatre, Paris1963: The Beatles live: Majestic Ballroom, Birkenhead1963: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)1962: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)Want more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
